只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh-gmail: Gmail plugin suite for DeepSeek Harness — 61 model-facing tools + 2 polling triggers over the Gmail & People APIs (OAuth2)","id":"gh:1346118908","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-gmail-plugins","slug":"sakthiveltofficial/dsh-gmail-plugins","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh-gmail: Gmail plugin suite for DeepSeek Harness — 61 model-facing tools + 2 polling triggers over"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" the Gmail & People APIs (OAuth2)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-gmail · Gmail Plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A complete, production-ready **Gmail plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)**. It gives the agent typed, "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"policy-aware access to Gmail over the official Gmail and People REST APIs — **63 model-facing tools*"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"* (send, search, draft, label, filter, thread, settings, contacts) and **2 polling triggers** — with"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" automatic OAuth2 token management."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Official ecosystem keyword:** this is a `dsh-plugin` — add the `dsh-plugin` GitHub topic to this"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" ecosystem keyword:** this is a `dsh-plugin` — add the `dsh-plugin` GitHub topic to this repository."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 🤖 LLM-readable summary"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **What:** a single Cordis plugin that extends DSH agents with 63 `gmail_*` tools + 2 polling trigg"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ers.\n- **Install:** `dsh plugin --profile web add github:sakthiveltofficial/dsh-gmail-plugins`, then"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" add one row to your profile patch (or agent preset) — see Install.\n- **Tools:** `gmail_send_email`,"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" `gmail_fetch_emails`, `gmail_fetch_message_by_message_id`, `gmail_fetch_message_by_thread_id`, `gma"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"il_list_threads`, `gmail_reply_to_thread`, `gmail_create_email_draft`, `gmail_send_draft`, `gmail_fo"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"rward_message`, label/filter/trash/settings/contacts tools — the full list is in the tool table.\n- *"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"*Auth:** OAuth2 (`gmail.modify`, `gmail.settings.basic`, `gmail.compose`, `gmail.send`, `contacts.re"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"adonly` scopes). Credentials are **never stored in config** — env-var references resolved per operat"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"ion via `ctx.credentials`. `gmail_authorize` runs the interactive Google sign-in and **captures + st"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"ores the refresh token automatically**; only `GMAIL_CLIENT_ID` / `GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET` need to be se"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"t.\n- **Triggers:** `gmail/message-received` (new mail) and `gmail/message-sent` (sent mail) — poll-b"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"ased, seeded on first activation so the mailbox is never replayed.\n- **Runtime requirements:** DeepS"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"eek Harness, Node.js ≥ 20 (global `fetch`), and a Google Cloud OAuth client with the Gmail (and Peop"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"le) API enabled.\n- **Safety:** permanent deletes (`gmail_delete_message`, `gmail_batch_delete_messag"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"es`, `gmail_delete_thread`, `gmail_delete_label`) are clearly labeled and require explicit user conf"},{"id":"p6s16","text":"irmation; the agent is prompted to prefer trash over permanent deletion unless the user asked for ir"},{"id":"p6s17","text":"reversible removal.\n- **License:** MIT."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## ✨ What it does"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Read & search** — fetch emails with Gmail query syntax, fetch a message by ID or a full thread, "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"list threads, list/get drafts, download attachments, get profile/history.\n- **Compose & send** — sen"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"d email (with attachments from local paths, URLs, or inline base64), create/update/send drafts, forw"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ard messages, reply inside a thread (correct `In-Reply-To`/`References` threading).\n- **Organize** —"},{"id":"p8s5","text":" add/remove labels (single message, batch of 1,000, or whole thread), create/patch/update/delete lab"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"els, create/list/get/delete filters.\n- **Administer** — IMAP/POP settings, auto-forwarding, vacation"},{"id":"p8s7","text":" responder, display language, send-as aliases, S/MIME configs, CSE identities/key pairs, stop watch "},{"id":"p8s8","text":"notifications.\n- **Contacts** — get contacts (connections), get a person or Other Contacts, search p"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"eople via the People API.\n- **One-click auth** — `gmail_authorize` opens the Google consent page in "},{"id":"p8s10","text":"your browser and captures + stores the refresh token automatically; no manual token generation.\n- **"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"Triggers** — poll for new received/sent mail and emit typed Cordis events for downstream listeners.\n"},{"id":"p8s12","text":"- **Resilience** — automatic access-token refresh with in-memory caching, 401-invalidate-and-retry, "},{"id":"p8s13","text":"bounded exponential backoff on 429/5xx, structured `GmailError`s with HTTP status preserved."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 🚀 Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 1. Install the package from this GitHub repository"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"This installs the `@google-workspace/dsh-gmail` plugin package into the profile (the repo root is th"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"e package — no build step needed)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 2. Mount the plugin in a composition"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The plugin publishes no services — it only registers tools into the host `tools` registry (plus the "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"optional `timer` service for triggers) — so it mounts as a plain loose row, with no `isolate` realm "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"`timer` service for triggers) — so it mounts as a plain loose row, with no `isolate` realm required."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Option A — profile patch (host plane, tools visible to every agent).** Append to your profile's `c"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ile patch (host plane, tools visible to every agent).** Append to your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Option B — agent preset (tools only for agents on that preset).** Add the row to the preset's `age"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ent preset (tools only for agents on that preset).** Add the row to the preset's `agent.cordis.yml`:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Restart the profile (or the DSH process)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Verify"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Then ask the agent: *\"what gmail tools do you have?\"* — it should list the `gmail_*` tools (63 in to"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ask the agent: *\"what gmail tools do you have?\"* — it should list the `gmail_*` tools (63 in total)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 🔑 Configure credentials (OAuth2)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Gmail requires OAuth2 — there is no API-key path. Config carries only **env-var references**, never "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"literal tokens; values are resolved per operation through DSH's credential service (process env → pr"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ovider store → `.env`)."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Env var | Used for |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🔒 Security"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **Secrets are never stored in config** — only env-var references (`GMAIL_CLIENT_ID` / `GMAIL_CLIEN"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"T_SECRET` / `GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN`), resolved per operation through `ctx.credentials` (process env → "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"provider store → `.env`). Literal config values are supported for quick setups but are not recommend"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ed for production.\n- **Access tokens are cached in memory only**, never persisted, and are refreshed"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" from the refresh token on demand.\n- **Destructive tools are clearly labeled** in their descriptions"},{"id":"p30s6","text":" (`permanent`, `no recovery possible`) and the agent is instructed to confirm with the user before p"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"ermanent deletes and to prefer trash for reversible workflows.\n- **Forward/reply recipients are expl"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"icit** — forwarding preserves content, so the agent is instructed to verify recipients before forwar"},{"id":"p30s9","text":"ding to avoid unintended exposure.\n- Minimum privilege: grant only the scopes your workflows need (d"},{"id":"p30s10","text":"rop `gmail.settings.basic` or `contacts.readonly` if unused — an over-scoped client can trigger the "},{"id":"p30s11","text":"\"App is blocked\" verification requirement)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
